const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"A plump sparrow seen from the front, its wings and tail spread into a fan. The belly, the back and the fan are circles about one point on the axis. The tail is ten feathers, a thirtieth of a turn each, with a white line between any two; each wing is as wide as five feathers, with four white lines along it, and its lower edge is ruled from the same point. A white line parts the tail from each wing, another runs along the top of each wing to the head, and a white line goes round the top of the head down to the level line through its middle. The eyes are white discs with a dot, and the beak is a white triangle. The right half of the tail is built in full, then the body with both wings, then the left half of the tail where it stands.","ja":"正面から見た、ふっくらした雀です。翼と尾を扇のように広げています。腹、背、扇は、中心線の上の一点を中心にした円です。尾は羽根十枚で、一枚は一周の三十分の一、羽根の間に白い線があります。翼は羽根五枚分の広さで、白い線が四本あります。翼の下の縁は、同じ点から引いた直線です。尾と翼の間に白い線が一本、翼の上の縁から頭まで白い線が一本あります。頭の上半分のまわりにも白い線があり、頭の中心を通る横の線で終わります。目は点のある白い円、くちばしは白い三角です。尾の右半分を作図し、次に体と両方の翼を作図し、尾の左半分はその場で作図します。"};

export default construction;
export { construction, description };
